.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH bap-bench 1  "bap-bench " 
.SH NAME
bap\-bench \- Measure script latency across pinned isolates
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbap\-bench\fR [\fB\-\-warmup\fR] [\fB\-\-iterations\fR] [\fB\-\-lanes\fR] [\fB\-\-trace\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> [\fISCRIPT_ARGS\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Measure script latency across pinned isolates
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-warmup\fR \fI<WARMUP>\fR [default: 0]
Unmeasured executions per lane before measuring
.TP
\fB\-\-iterations\fR \fI<ITERATIONS>\fR [default: 100]
Measured requests distributed round\-robin across lanes
.TP
\fB\-\-lanes\fR \fI<LANES>\fR [default: 1]
Long\-lived isolates; each owns a thread
.TP
\fB\-\-trace\fR \fI<TRACE>\fR
Write a chrome\-trace JSON document to this path
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: pretty]
Output format
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
pretty
.IP \(bu 2
json
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
Script executed once per request
.TP
[\fISCRIPT_ARGS\fR]
arguments passed to the script (use `\-\-` before dash\-args)
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  bap bench bench/ssr/request.mjs \-\-warmup 10 \-\-iterations 200 \-\-lanes 3
  bap bench unit.mjs \-\-trace trace.json
